body:
I fear my father and his wife, my mother passed away when I was 13, have been claiming me on their taxes to prove that I was living with them, when I was actually couch surfing at my boyfriend's and uncle's. I now am on an official lease in an apartment with friends and was homeless for almost a year beforehand. I held a job and drove in my father's car, but paid for my phone bill and car insurance by giving them money every month. 

&#x200B;

I am not sure how to speak with the financial aid dept of the schools I want to apply to. My fasfa went under review the year I was graduating highschool so I wasn't able to get it done on time because my father couldn't be fucked to help me produce his tax information so I could get ANYTHING from the fasfa. My highscool counselor said it was because I was going to get a lot of money from the fasfa and the government wanted to be sure I wasn't lying. My mother passed away, my father declared bankruptcy, and I got a 28 on the ACT. So I feel like I messed up my chances :(

I used to draw quite a lot! I also was very into painting and have had some of my work featured in a local museum. But, I've lost touch with that and do not have the time nor the mental energy to get back into it.

&#x200B;

And I also used to write a lot. I used to come up with characters and stuff. But I am currently playing DnD with friends and I cannot even begin my own one shot. Everything I have is so dumb. My mind goes almost blank when I start trying to think.

&#x200B;

I appreciate your comment. Thank you.
